{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>ואל, את עבדך</b> — like עִם. The meaning: if I have sinned against You, do not enter into judgment with me now, for I have great trouble from the enemy, and altogether no living thing is justified before You, so how shall I be justified?!"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 143, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:33.474755365Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}